This directory exists only so graphqlcodegen-maven-plugin's "dgs-codegen"
execution (pom.xml) doesn't fail the build with "Configured path ... does not
exist" — CLAUDE.md's claim that a missing directory here is a harmless no-op
is wrong for this plugin version; it throws a hard PluginExecutionException
instead. See CLAUDE.md's GraphQL codegen section for what this is for
(client-code generation from *.graphqls schema files) — none exist here yet,
so this stays empty until a real client schema is added.
